Package: enigma2-plugin-softcams-cccam3
Version: 3.0.1
Section: softcams
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Sharillas <sharillas@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: CCcam3 - servidor de cardsharing para enigma2
 Servidor de cardsharing com clientes CCcam/Newcamd, leitores remotos,
 leitor DVB S/S2/C/C2, API REST e painel web.
 Binarios totalmente estaticos (sem dependencias de libc/openssl).
 Instalavel em OpenPLi/OpenATV/OpenViX (OE 1.6/2.0 ou superior).
